    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 32 read with Section 25 of the Excise Ordinance (Chapter 52), as amendedfrom time to time I, Ravi Karunanayake, Minister of Finance do by this Order direct the following with effect from01.01.2017.",
